sion, they often arrive before their subordinates to soften the enemy frontlines with incredible speed, while simultaneously planning their next action.","abilities":["Attacks reduce DP when carrying ammo. Ammo capacity: 3"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":7500,"atk":650,"def":350,"res":35,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"sentry_spymaster":{"slug":"sentry_spymaster","name":"Sentry Spymaster","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sentry Spymaster.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A spy hired by a mysterious employer to monitor their rivals while disguised as civilians. They know the blockade inside-out, and prefer to first gather enough crucial information before proceeding to the next step of their plans.","abilities":["Spy","When their identity is revealed, becomes Invisible"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.65,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":800,"def":200,"res":35,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.3}},"pathfinder_spymaster":{"slug":"pathfinder_spymaster","name":"Pathfinder Spymaster","icon":"/enemies-icons/Pathfinder Spymaster.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A spy hired by a mysterious employer to monitor their rivals while disguised as civilians. These seasoned operatives will occasionally employ less orthodox methods to get their more impatient rivals to let down their guard.","abilities":["Spy","When their identity is revealed, the next attack's ATK is greatly increased"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.65,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":600,"def":350,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.3}},"sarkaz_greatswordsman":{"slug":"sarkaz_greatswordsman",